course: dictionary
lesson: 7934
title: Reality: what is real
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: Reality is what really exists or happens. It is not something you imagine, dream or pretend. «In reality, the dragon was only a kite.» The words in reality tell you the true answer, even if something first looked different.
explain: Reality can also mean a fact or situation you have to face. «The reality of living on a farm is early mornings and muddy boots.» Here reality means the true, sometimes hard, side of life.
explain: Some reality is made by computers. Virtual reality (VR) is a computer world you can see through a headset. Reality shows on TV film real people, but the producers often plan scenes and edit them, so they are not as natural as they look.
fact: Reality means what really exists or happens.
fact: «In reality» means «actually».
fact: A reality is a fact or situation you have to face.
fact: Virtual reality (VR) is a computer world you can see with a headset.
fact: «Reality shows» film real people, but the scenes are often planned by producers and edited into a story.
exercise: Sam says, «In reality, it was only a kite.» What does in reality mean? | Once upon a time | *Actually | Very loudly | Never
exercise: What does virtual reality mean? | A dream you have at night | A real farm with animals | *A computer world you can see with a headset | A film with no actors
exercise: «The reality of living on a farm is hard work.» What is a reality here? | A happy dream | A pretend story | *A fact or situation you have to face | A type of tractor
test: «Reality shows plan scenes and edit them into a story.» What does this tell you? | They are only cartoons | *They are often planned and edited | They have no people in them | They are always completely accidental
test: In a story, reality is the opposite of | A sunny day | A kitchen table | A school trip | *A dream or magic world
exam: «Reality shows plan scenes and edit them into a story; the people in them are still real.» What is true? | The people are not real at all | The show is a cartoon | Nothing in the show is planned | *The people are real, but the scenes are planned and edited
